"""Official 2027 Division B rules for every seeded event.

Summarized (not copied) from the coach-supplied Science Olympiad 2027
Division B Rules Manual, one entry per event on the portal. Each entry
fills a Topic's description, assessment_type and the five overview_*
fields the student page shows as the event's rules (see TopicOverview.tsx
and lessons._rules_passages).

The manual is the source of truth: `apply_official_rules` runs on every
startup after the per-event seeds in main.py and writes these values
unconditionally onto the top-level event rows, so an older summary built
from wiki snapshots or search snippets never survives a deploy. Rule
corrections and clarifications posted on soinc.org still apply on top of
the printed manual -- the notes below say so where a number is likely to
be clarified.

Trial events printed in the manual (Code Craze, Hydraulics, Protein
Builders) are deliberately not here: the portal only seeds the confirmed
national roster (see main._remove_unconfirmed_trial_events).
"""

from app import models
from app.db import SessionLocal

